+        # Create the null-sink at the rate of the streamed encoder so the
+        # monitor output (and thus the DLNA stream and DAC) runs at the
+        # source-native rate instead of the PulseAudio default (48 kHz).
+        # Otherwise 44.1 kHz content gets resampled to 48 kHz and the DAC
